WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.148 --> 00:00:02.913
- Do you do this ranch
in pizza abomination?

00:00:02.913 --> 00:00:03.784
- No, I don't.

00:00:03.784 --> 00:00:06.092
I have a fully developed taste palette,

00:00:06.092 --> 00:00:09.332
so I don't have any need to dip my pizza

00:00:09.332 --> 00:00:10.999
into ranch dressing.

00:00:13.136 --> 00:00:16.060
- Today we're trying
something revolutionary.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:16.893
- Is it?

00:00:16.893 --> 00:00:17.726
- I don't know.

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:18.559
It's kind of gross.

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:20.248
It's ranch dressing on a pizza.

00:00:20.248 --> 00:00:21.918
- I used to love ranch as a kid

00:00:21.918 --> 00:00:23.442
but I haven't had it recently.

00:00:23.442 --> 00:00:24.275
- Same.

00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:25.820
I used to have it in middle school

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.674
and I can't remember having it since then.

00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:29.177
- It's a thing we do
with like mid grade chain

00:00:29.177 --> 00:00:30.783
and or freezer pizza.

00:00:30.783 --> 00:00:31.616
- Exactly.

00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:33.388
- I don't think it's a
thing you do with pizza.

00:00:33.388 --> 00:00:35.626
- Yeah, there's like pizza
and then there's pizza.

00:00:35.626 --> 00:00:36.530
- Are we pizza snobs?

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:37.436
- Yeah.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:38.478
- I'm not one to do this

00:00:38.478 --> 00:00:40.766
because I don't like ranch dressing.

00:00:40.766 --> 00:00:43.077
But I do know it's
something that people love.

00:00:43.077 --> 00:00:44.591
- The only thing, pizza I don't like

00:00:44.591 --> 00:00:46.141
is gummy bears and sardines.

00:00:46.141 --> 00:00:47.698
- Have you had gummy bear pizza?

00:00:47.698 --> 00:00:49.614
- No but it doesn't sound good.

00:00:49.614 --> 00:00:50.922
- I could go for it.

00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:51.755
- Tada.

00:00:51.755 --> 00:00:53.161
- I love pizza.

00:00:53.161 --> 00:00:54.910
- This is a good example of pizza

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:58.462
that I would not think of
dipping in ranch dressing.

00:00:58.462 --> 00:00:59.295
- Yeah.

00:00:59.295 --> 00:01:00.128
- This is like decent pizza

00:01:00.128 --> 00:01:01.214
that taste very good on it's own.

00:01:01.214 --> 00:01:02.047
- Alright.

00:01:02.047 --> 00:01:02.880
- I'm open minded.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.295
- I'm just going all out.

00:01:04.295 --> 00:01:06.082
That looks so gross.

00:01:06.082 --> 00:01:06.997
- Oh, it's dripping.

00:01:06.997 --> 00:01:08.308
What if I throw up?

00:01:08.308 --> 00:01:09.141
- I'm not that nervous.

00:01:09.141 --> 00:01:11.724
This is a pretty tame endeavor.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.006
- I really wanted to like it.

00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:17.839
- I don't like it.

00:01:17.839 --> 00:01:20.313
- It's not like awful or disgusting.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.440
It's just like the pizza
is fine on it's own.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:24.273
- It's good.

00:01:24.273 --> 00:01:25.889
I feel it's healthy 'cause
it feels like when you dip

00:01:25.889 --> 00:01:28.033
carrots into ranch, it
kind of taste like that.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.630
- Yeah, I feel like we're
eating carrot sticks

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:31.069
but a carby version.

00:01:31.069 --> 00:01:32.957
- Right now I'm falling
somewhere between neutral

00:01:32.957 --> 00:01:34.154
and positive.

00:01:34.154 --> 00:01:35.915
Like either it's not adding anything

00:01:35.915 --> 00:01:38.991
or it's adding like a nice
little something that I like.

00:01:38.991 --> 00:01:39.940
I just can't tell.

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:40.843
I'm conflicted.

00:01:40.843 --> 00:01:41.676
- It's too much.

00:01:41.676 --> 00:01:42.714
Too many flavors.

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:43.724
- I hate it.

00:01:43.724 --> 00:01:45.284
- It's a good way to ruin a pizza.

00:01:45.284 --> 00:01:48.083
- I kind of like the coolness
of the ranch on the pizza.

00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:49.787
I feel like adds a new layer.

00:01:49.787 --> 00:01:51.293
- I would argue that it's overpowering.

00:01:51.293 --> 00:01:53.138
I taste more ranch than pizza

00:01:53.138 --> 00:01:54.237
and then I feel like that kind of defeats

00:01:54.237 --> 00:01:55.540
the purpose of pizza.

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:59.123
- I stake a large part
of my reputation in.

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:05.352
Oh, you are ...

00:02:05.352 --> 00:02:06.479
Your face is lighting up.

00:02:06.479 --> 00:02:07.312
- Guys.

00:02:07.312 --> 00:02:08.145
- I'm nerve.

00:02:08.145 --> 00:02:09.539
- I think this is actually really good.

00:02:09.539 --> 00:02:11.067
- I wouldn't go out of my way to get it

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:13.394
but if I was sitting at a
table and there was pizza

00:02:13.394 --> 00:02:16.136
and there was some ranch I
might dip a couple bites in.

00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:16.969
- I like ranch, so I'm into it

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.087
and especially if you have a spicy bite,

00:02:19.087 --> 00:02:20.579
like this would like cool it down.

00:02:20.579 --> 00:02:22.483
- Honestly I think what I'm experiencing

00:02:22.483 --> 00:02:24.395
is a really good just bread dipping sauce.

00:02:24.395 --> 00:02:26.957
Like if you had some garlic
breads and cheesy garlic bread,

00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:28.773
then you've got yourself a time.

00:02:28.773 --> 00:02:30.010
- That's absolutely what it is.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:30.873
- Then you got something going.

00:02:30.873 --> 00:02:32.476
- It's the bread in the ranch.

00:02:32.476 --> 00:02:33.966
It's not pizza in ranch.

00:02:33.966 --> 00:02:34.825
It's bread in ranch.

00:02:34.825 --> 00:02:35.979
And the crust is close enough.

00:02:35.979 --> 00:02:36.812
- Absolutely.

00:02:36.812 --> 00:02:37.645
- Yeah.

00:02:37.645 --> 00:02:38.478
- It doesn't make it better.

00:02:38.478 --> 00:02:39.311
- It doesn't make it better.

00:02:39.311 --> 00:02:41.144
It makes it different.

00:02:41.144 --> 00:02:43.099
Sometimes you wanna try something new.

00:02:43.099 --> 00:02:45.254
- So, I think it was really
interesting to try the ranch

00:02:45.254 --> 00:02:47.469
with pizza and for me that
just opens up the door

00:02:47.469 --> 00:02:49.938
to trying more sauces with pizza,

00:02:49.938 --> 00:02:53.649
like hot sauce with pizza
and honey with pizza,

00:02:53.649 --> 00:02:56.649
maybe even Arby's sauce with pizza.

